@opener rh="DEEP-DIVE DOSSIER I · GENESIS" m="SOURCE MARGIN; GEN 1–50; MT · LXX; ALTER, GENESIS (TRANS.); WESTERMANN, GENESIS 1–11; TKC: AM"
plate: quote
pk: Genesis 1.28
pq: Be fruitful and multiply, and fill the earth and subdue it,
pq: and have dominion over the fish of the sea and over the birds of the air and over every living thing that moves upon the earth.
pr: The verse the Dominions are named after (AM). Fish, birds and living things. No people.
